### Health — 503 until `make index` has embedded the catalog
GET {{host}}/health

### Products — filtered browse, no LLM involved
GET {{host}}/products?category=laptops&max_price_cents=150000

### Q&A — first message creates a session; copy session_id from the response into http-client.env.json
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need something really light to carry around while traveling"
}

### Q&A — follow-up in the same session resolves "the cheaper one" from history
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "Is there a cheaper one?"
}

### Order — draft; the response carries confirm_token
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "I want to buy two ProBook 15"
}

### Order — confirm with the token from the draft
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "yes please",
  "confirm_token": "{{confirm_token}}"
}

### Track
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "Where is my order?"
}

### Returns — cancel while processing (policy §1)
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "I changed my mind, cancel my order"
}

### Compare
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "Compare the ProBook 15 and the UltraBook 13 Air"
}

### Streaming — server-sent events: session, step, delta, done
POST {{host}}/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

{
  "message": "Wireless headphones under $150"
}

### Orders for this session
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Session-Id: {{session}}

### Off-topic — refused by the router
POST {{host}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Write me a Python script that scrapes a website"
}
